{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aKunKun dream Startles the Soul\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multiplayer online horror and funny game, the game supports 1~4 people to play. Escape the KunKun\u2019s Dreamscape with your friends in an experimental dream full of ghosts and animals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/e7ba9c7e80d8e3cf5508aabd8f8f5724.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=338 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aBackground of the story\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day when you surf your mobile phone on the Internet, you accidentally brush a kind of Kunkun graphic virus, the human eye will fall asleep when you see the graphic virus, and when you wake up, you arrive at a place that is both familiar and unfamiliar, and you also meet a companion who is trapped here, this place is full of scary and funny ghost animals, echoing in the corridor of the rooster crow, uneasy atmosphere. Can you escape from this &quot;KunKun\u2019s Dreamscape&quot;?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/7690a2b87233d3b9160741d69c987cab.poster.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/7690a2b87233d3b9160741d69c987cab.webm?t=1771774892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/7690a2b87233d3b9160741d69c987cab.mp4?t=1771774892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/863aa0b13d6b129369d855463680bdb2.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aGameplay\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the illusory dream, obtain items and information, solve puzzles, and hunt down ghosts and animals. Team up with your teammates to explore the environment for clues, collect key items, and solve the mysteries hidden in KunKun\u2019s Dreamscape one by one, and finally piece together the truth behind them!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/de1b3b93c641a49c812babab52d8a9a9.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=325 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aOnline multiplayer\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports up to 1~4 people to play in a team, and the challenge is to escape from the &quot;KunKun\u2019s Dreamscape&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide up the work to explore, fight for hideouts, and enjoy multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/be2cb71c2170c24f9a4bc1fc97ad9f0c.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=316 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/674bddedb18be47a50576f22b6cb33ae.poster.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/674bddedb18be47a50576f22b6cb33ae.webm?t=1771774892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/674bddedb18be47a50576f22b6cb33ae.mp4?t=1771774892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aMultiple maps\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently has five maps where you have to face off against ghost animals: KunKun melon buyer Brother Jie They pose a threat to you but are also hilarious and scary! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/ea0c68ce1f5523da5be58f9c60d4725d.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=344 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/2225a4a4795be6bb601da0062f1dd509.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=336 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/c7d0662b6d55e92fe0560eacdad1fde8.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=322 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aLao Da Beverage\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you can look for key power-ups: Lao Da Beverage, which will help you increase your running speed and stamina, and the Prison Drink, which will give you a lot of energy! Miss you, Laoda!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/eba3ac93a92470765d5d411009321a61.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=266 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/0ead90b5980fcfd31f589f359d0b350f.poster.avif?t=1771774892\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/0ead90b5980fcfd31f589f359d0b350f.webm?t=1771774892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/extras/0ead90b5980fcfd31f589f359d0b350f.mp4?t=1771774892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aAnxiolytics\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\