DIA GTX 960 4GB / AMD RX 550 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 8GB / AMD RX 5700 XT 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":299,"final_formatted":"$2.99 USD","initial":299,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["AIKUN"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":398},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"24 Jun, 2024"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cKunKun dream Startles the Soul&quot; is a multiplayer online game that combines horror and comedy elements. Players need to solve puzzles and escape in a dream full of ghost creatures. The game supports 1 to 4 players and has various maps and special props, but there are some technical problems at this stage, such as inconvenient volume control and online delay, which affect the game experience. I hope the production team will work hard in the later stage and fix the problems so as not to disappoint the expectations of IKUNs. It is tested that the TDP above 10W can be played smoothly.\u201d<br>8\u5206 \u2013 GPD\u638c\u673a<br><br>\u201cWhat are you doing?! You scared me to death! KunKun dream Startles the Soulis a first\u2011person horror walking simulator, packed with our favorite &quot;brother&quot; memes and viral internet jokes. This game supports multiplayer co\u2011op for up to 4 players in a room. You\u2019ll solve puzzles inside a dream world teeming with goofy creatures while dodging their attacks \u2014 the monsters are actually hilarious! You can hide in cabinets or even sacrifice your teammates, and you\u2019ll need to manage your limited inventory smartly. The game is a lot of fun! As true iKun, we respect our brother more than anyone else in the world and stand by him through all the gossip \u2014 don\u2019t even ask where the rumors come from! Play it now!\u201d<br>\u63a8\u8350 \u2013 \u6e38\u620f\u9ad8\u624b\u9274\u8d4f\u7ec4<br><br>\u201cA multiplayer online chaotic puzzle escape game supporting up to 4 players in a room. Presented in 3D scenes as terrifying dreamscapes, you must escape nightmares filled with various absurd creatures. Use cabinets or your teammates to distract these beings while solving puzzles. The seemingly horror-themed environments are sprinkled with internet memes. Find items and hidden clues, decipher mechanisms, and always manage your anxiety level. Remember: don\u2019t stare at the chaotic beings for too long. Make good use of &quot;Lao Da Drink&quot; to strengthen yourself. Ultimately, there are dual endings\u2014will you be an &quot;iKun&quot; or a &quot;hater&quot;? Check out the achievements and decide.\u201d<br>\u63a8\u8350 \u2013 \u9c7c\u6c64\u91cc\u7684\u54b8\u9c7c<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/ss_d2156a5433f6a88b922b35053d81625348673442.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771774892","path_thumbna